<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal cement consumption up 28 pct yr/yr Jan.</title>
<headline>Portugal cement consumption up 28 pct yr/yr Jan.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumption of cement rose 28 percent year-on-year in Portugal in January 1997 to 712,000 tonnes, according to figures from the Association of Construction and Public Works Companies (AECOPS).</p>
<p>&quot;According to responses from business in the sector (construction and public works), this favourable scenario should be maintained in the coming months,&quot; AECOPS said in a study.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
